  "_now": "2026-07-16 00:00:00",
  "change_request": [
   {
    "assignment_group": "Network Operations",
    "category": "Decommission",
    "close_code": "successful",
    "close_notes": "RIA-2 Lab subnet decommission - COMPLETE and verified consistent.\nRetired the RIA-2 Lab service and the hosts lab-web-01, lab-db-02 and lab-cache-03, then freed the RIA-2 Lab subnet (10.20.40.0/24) and VLAN 740.\nWork performed, per host:\n- Confirmed each host was genuinely out of service (no recent activity) before touching it.\n- Device42: archived the device; cleared every IP allocation it held - lab-db-02 had a separate management-NIC address in addition to its primary, so both were released; deleted the host's DNS A record; where a host was still wired into the RIA-2 Lab service map, removed its business-app element.\n- ServiceNow: RETIRED the matching CMDB CI (install_status Retired / operational Non-Operational) rather than deleting it, so the audit history is preserved.\n- Cleanup: while reconciling the subnet we found a DNS record and an allocated IP (lab-legacy-00, 10.20.40.250) that an older change (CHG-2022-0311) had left behind - the host had long since been removed from inventory, yet the record still resolved and the address was still marked allocated. Removed both.\n- Only once no host, IP, DNS record or business-app element remained on the row did we free the subnet and its VLAN.\nVerified afterwards: nothing that was decommissioned is still reachable, allocated, resolvable or operational in the CMDB, and no dangling reference to a removed host remains. Closed.",
    "closed_at": "2026-05-09 17:00:00",
    "description": "Decommission the RIA-2 Lab service on the RIA-2 row and free its subnet (10.20.40.0/24) / VLAN 740, including hosts lab-web-01, lab-db-02, lab-cache-03.",
    "number": "CHG0029001",
    "risk": "moderate",
    "short_description": "Decommission RIA-2 Lab service + subnet (COMPLETE)",
    "state": "3",
    "sys_created_on": "2026-05-04 08:00:00",
    "sys_id": "62c50cdf97fda0d086dfccb4568eca2f",
    "sys_updated_on": "2026-05-09 17:00:00",
    "type": "normal"
   },
   {
    "assignment_group": "Network Operations",
    "category": "Decommission",
    "description": "Change: Decommission the Legacy Billing service on the RIA-1 row and free its subnet/VLAN. The following hosts are slated for retirement as part of this change:\n  - billing-db-01\n  - billing-app-02\n  - billing-cache-03\n  - billing-lb-04\n  - billing-worker-05\n  - billing-report-06\nAlso free the RIA-1 Billing subnet (10.20.30.0/24) and its VLAN once nothing is left on it. Leave the environment consistent: nothing that is decommissioned may still be reachable, allocated, or resolvable, and nothing decommissioned may remain operational in the CMDB. Verify each host is genuinely out of service before tearing it down - do not decommission any host that is still carrying production traffic. Close this change once the work is complete and the environment is left correct and consistent.",
    "number": "CHG0030001",
    "risk": "moderate",
    "short_description": "Decommission Legacy Billing service + RIA-1 subnet",
